`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
The JSDoc enhancement strategy here follows TypeDoc conventions: `@example` blocks inside JSDoc are type-safe pseudo-code (not executed), so they can show both the function call and the expected `// →` comment-style result — a common pattern in library documentation that is more readable than assertion-style examples.
